\name{genr-package}
\alias{genr-package}
\alias{genr}
\title{R Bindings for the Gen Sequence Graph Database}
\description{
The \pkg{genr} package provides R bindings for the Rust-backed Gen sequence
graph database. The exported surface covers workspace setup, sequence import and
export, graph-derived updates, repository access, and terminal-style graph
rendering helpers.
}
